 ast 2 years Nimesh has self-released three stand-up specials and has charte
 d a path from sold out comedy clubs to major theaters. Nimesh most recently
  appeared on The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon and before that made his la
 te night debut on Late Night with Seth Meyers. His self-released specials 
 “Jokes To Get You Through Quarantine\,” “Thank You\, China\,” and 
 “Lucky Lefty” have amassed millions of views. His first writing job cam
 e after Chris Rock saw him perform standup and hired him directly to write 
